{"title":"Elasticities and incidence","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918034640/0/marginalrevolution~Elasticities-and-incidence.html","date":1746814058000,"content":"<blockquote><p>President Trump’s budget proposes a significant rethink of federal rental assistance programs, consolidating a number of them — and cutting them by more than $26 billion — next fiscal year. Many experts <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/04/17/us/politics/housing-aid-hud-federal-budget.html\">previously told The New York Times</a> that this could result in low-income Americans losing access to federal housing benefits.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/live/2025/05/02/us/trump-budget-2026\" target=\"_blank\">more from the NYT</a>.  If you are a YIMBY type, odds are you should favor this, since some of the subsidy gain likely would end up captured by landlords.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/elasticities-and-incidence.html\">Elasticities and incidence</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918034640/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918034640/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918034640/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918034640/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/918034640/marginalrevolution\"><